(
"MK1 LAWS over a literal carrier: two fact types, the rows of one in two chunks. Membership is application: a fact the population holds answers T and one it does not F; the rows read through the object are the chunks unfolded, and an empty chunk is no row; the reflected Fact Type has Role and Object Type plays Role hold the roles the declared players give; a head that names no fact type answers #.",
DEF("test:k_lit",
    K(S2(S3(A("CELL"), A("state:fts"), S1(S3(S5(A("PersonHasName"), S2(A("Person"), A("Name")), S1(S1(N(1))), PHI(), S2(S2(S2(A("p1"), A("Ann")), S2(A("p2"), A("Bea"))), S1(S2(A("p3"), A("Cy"))))), S5(A("PersonIsHappy"), S1(A("Person")), PHI(), PHI(), S1(S1(A("p1")))), S5(A("PersonIsSad"), S1(A("Person")), PHI(), PHI(), S1(PHI()))))), S3(A("CELL"), A("state:declared"), S1(S2(S2(A("PersonHasName"), S2(A("Person"), A("Name"))), S2(A("PersonIsHappy"), S1(A("Person"))))))))),
DEF("test:k_member",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("k:all"), S5(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S3(A("PersonHasName"), A("p3"), A("Cy"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(A("T")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S3(A("PersonHasName"), A("p3"), A("Ann"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(A("F")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S2(A("PersonIsHappy"), A("p1"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(A("T")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S2(A("NoSuchFact"), A("p1"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(A("#"))))))),
DEF("test:k_rows",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("k:all"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S1(A("PersonHasName"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("rows")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(S3(S2(A("p1"), A("Ann")), S2(A("p2"), A("Bea")), S2(A("p3"), A("Cy")))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S1(A("PersonIsSad"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("rows")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(PHI())))))),
DEF("test:k_reflect",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("k:all"), S5(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S3(A("FactTypeHasRole"), A("PersonHasName"), A("PersonHasName.2"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(A("T")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S3(A("ObjectTypePlaysRole"), A("Name"), A("PersonHasName.2"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(A("T")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S3(A("ObjectTypePlaysRole"), A("Person"), A("PersonIsHappy.1"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(A("T")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S3(A("ObjectTypePlaysRole"), A("Person"), A("PersonHasName.2"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("test:k_lit"))))), K(A("F"))))))),
"MK1 LAW over the base the host composes (the operand is the cells): a fact the metamodel`s readings assert, and a role the reflection reads off the declared pairs.",
DEF("test:k_base",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("k:all"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S3(A("ObjectTypeIsOfObjectKind"), A("API"), A("entity"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("id"))))), K(A("T")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:rho"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S3(A("FactTypeHasRole"), A("ObjectTypeIsOfObjectKind"), A("ObjectTypeIsOfObjectKind.1"))), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("member")), S3(A("COMP"), A("k:boot"), A("id"))))), K(A("T"))))))),
"The report: <cells, address> to <text, verdict>, each law applied to the cells, as the host contract asks of main.",
DEF("test:k_names",
    K(S4(A("test:k_member"), A("test:k_rows"), A("test:k_reflect"), A("test:k_base")))),
DEF("main",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("test:k_text"), S3(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), A("apply"))), S3(A("COMP"), A("distr"), S3(A("CONS"), A("test:k_names"), N(1)))))),
DEF("test:k_text",
    S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("implode"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("\n")), S2(A("ALPHA"), S3(A("COMP"), A("implode"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A(" ")), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), N(2))))))), S3(A("COMP"), S4(A("COND"), A("k:all"), K(A("T")), K(A("F"))), S2(A("ALPHA"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), N(2), K(A("T"))))))))
)
